<item><title><![CDATA[Better Late Than Never: Autumn Is Finally Here 🍂]]></title><description><![CDATA[Casta&#241;as, bufandas y tardes oscuras: el vocabulario que necesitas esta temporada]]></description><link>https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/better-late-than-never-autumn-is</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/better-late-than-never-autumn-is</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Learning Spanish with Myriam]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 06:13:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xiJh!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F28d74318-0bb8-4a55-b198-bec2789e77bb_4080x2136.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>This post is written in Spanish on purpose. You don&#8217;t need to understand every word, just keep reading.</strong></p><p>Este a&#241;o, al menos en Londres y en otras ciudades como Madrid o Par&#237;s, al oto&#241;o le ha costado m&#225;s de lo habitual abrirse camino. De hecho, no ha sido hasta casi un mes despu&#233;s de su llegada oficial cuando por fin hemos empezado a notarlo. Pero, como se suele decir, <strong>&#161;m&#225;s vale tarde que nunca!</strong></p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xiJh!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F28d74318-0bb8-4a55-b198-bec2789e77bb_4080x2136.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xiJh!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F28d74318-0bb8-4a55-b198-bec2789e77bb_4080x2136.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xiJh!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,f